-- src:5213 | (5) Shares held by directors of a company for the purpose of complying with any share qualification requirement shall be disregarded in determining for the purposes of this section whether the company is a wholly-owned subsidiary.
@ref s 401(5) Directors' qualification shares are disregarded in deciding whether the company is wholly-owned (src:5213)
GIVEN `the number of members other than the parent undertaking, its wholly-owned subsidiaries and persons acting on behalf of them` IS A NUMBER
