GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 402 the parent company is exempt from the requirement to prepare group accounts` MEANS
    IF null `s 405 the answers, for each subsidiary undertaking, whether it could be excluded from consolidation in Companies Act group accounts`
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): a parent company has at least one subsidiary undertaking, so an empty list is outside the section
    ELSE `s 362 helper every answer` `s 405 the answers, for each subsidiary undertaking, whether it could be excluded from consolidation in Companies Act group accounts`
         -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A parent company is exempt from the requirement to prepare group accounts if under section 405 all of its subsidiary undertakings could be excluded from consolidation"

-- ---- s 403: group accounts: applicable accounting framework ------------------------------------------------------------------------

