    `s 403(2)(a) Companies Act group accounts`
    `s 403(2)(b) IAS group accounts`

-- src:5219 | (1) The group accounts of a parent company whose securities are, on its balance sheet date, admitted to trading on a UK regulated market must be prepared in accordance with UK-adopted international accounting standards (“IAS group accounts”).
